# PMI surface reactions for CPC benchmark
# W impurity on W surfaces
# R=0.5, Y=0.1 (probabilities from constant-mode, not from this file)
#
# Reflect: W neutral bounces off surface as W neutral
W --> W
R Simple 1.0

# Sputter: W neutral absorbed, new W atom emitted from surface
W --> W
S Simple 1.0

# Absorb: W neutral sticks to surface
W --> NULL
A Simple 1.0
